        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG267 Stainless Steel Restroom Door Bolt with Occupancy Indicator</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThis restroom door bolt also has an Occupancy Indicator outside. Normally used on commercial restroom doors where privacy is required.  Emergency entry from outside using simple tool (no key required) such as a normal screwdriver. All stainless steel construction with a <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b> finish. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-9523-side.jpg?v=1704442260\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG267 Occupancy Indicator Doorbolt Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nStainless Steel doorbolt, extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasion making it an ideal material for industrial and commercial door hardware. It needs little looking after and does not degrade in appearance or function with use. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on commercial and public restroom doors that require locking inside, and with an occupancy indicator outside. <b>Red</b> indicator shows outside when locked. Both exterior and interior plates are surface mounted with concealed screws for a clean installation. <b>For use with 3/4\" bore hole.</b> \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for AHI SIG267 Stainless Steel Occupancy Indicator Doorbolt\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2.1\" (53 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Projection: 1.22\" (31 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Length: 1.45\" (37 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Width: 0.67\" (17 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole: 3/4\" (19 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><b>Satin Stainless Steel Finish</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSold as complete set. Inside Thumbturn, outside Occupancy Indicator, Door Bolt and Strike Plate. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n*Does <b>NOT</b> fit a <b>2-1/8\" bore hole</b>. \r\n</p>",
