                "title": "Stainless Steel Restroom Door Bolt with Occupancy Indicator, AHI SIG267",
                "description": "AHI SIG267 Stainless Steel Turnbolt with Occupancy Indicator. This restroom door bolt also has an Occupancy Indicator outside. Normally used on commercial restroom doors where privacy is required by the rooms occupant.  Emergency entry from outside using simple tool (no key required) such as a normal screwdriver. All stainless steel construction with a Satin Stainless Steel finish. ",
